1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
[wind howling softly]

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,500
[door creaking open]

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,000
SARAH: Is someone there?

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,500
[footsteps echoing]

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,000
JAMES: It's just me, Sarah.

6
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,500
You scared me half to death!

7
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,000
[thunder rumbling in distance]

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,500
Sorry, I didn't mean to
startle you.

9
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,000
[rain pattering on roof]

10
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,500
What are you doing here
so late?

11
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,000
I needed to check
the old records.

12
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,500
[papers rustling]

13
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,000
In this weather?

14
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,500
[clock ticking loudly]

15
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,000
It couldn't wait until tomorrow.

16
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,500
[glass clinking]

17
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,000
SARAH: At least let me
make you some tea.

18
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,500
[kettle whistling]

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,000
JAMES: You're an angel.

20
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:50,500
[owl hooting outside]

21
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,000
So what did you find?

22
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,500
[fire crackling]

23
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,000
Something I wasn't expecting.

24
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,500
[wind howling louder]

25
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:03,000
SARAH: What is it?
